comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T06:50:07.054Z",codex-agent,"Plan: update homepage and author in package.json, preserve repository and bugs, set and verify the GitHub website, run local manifest checks, and regenerate the changelog. CI provides the full gate; npm metadata changes on the next release."
  "2026-10-26T06:50:37.145Z",codex-agent,"Verified GitHub website: https://pm-cli.unbrained.dev/packages/pm-github. Local linked checks passed: npm run lint; npm run typecheck; npm run pack:dry-run. Package metadata now matches the owner request and repository/bugs are unchanged. Metadata-only change: no runtime behavior changes, so behavioral revert proof is not applicable. Full release gates are delegated to CI as requested; no release or merge performed."
  "2026-10-26T07:28:30.748Z",codex-agent,"Review follow-up: the previous typecheck and pack checks did not guard metadata values. Add four node:test assertions for the exact homepage, linked author, repository, and bugs fields; prove independent homepage and author reverts fail; restore metadata; push and wait for CI on the final commit."
  "2026-10-26T07:28:43.714Z",codex-agent,"Revert-sensitive proof: node --test test/package-metadata.test.ts passes 4/4 assertions. Reverting only homepage to its original README URL fails exactly the homepage assertion (3 pass, 1 fail, exit 1). Reverting only author to its original string fails exactly the author assertion (3 pass, 1 fail, exit 1). Restored package.json byte-for-byte and reran: 4 pass, 0 fail. The existing test and coverage globs include test/package-metadata.test.ts, and release:check invokes coverage. Test compilation and lint passed. Full npm/Bun release gates will be checked in CI."
